```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.circle.unfollows nym/<nym>]] ~ remove needs a nym`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the follow store refused; the line names why`>>
```

